{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0013", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "半夜", "display_form": "半夜", "pos": "time noun, noun", "rank": 13, "pronunciation": "bànyè"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "midnight; the middle of the night", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "A time noun meaning midnight or the middle of the night."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0013-ex1", "sentence": "他半夜身体不舒服，家里人都很着急。", "meaning_en": "midnight", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0013-ex2", "sentence": "半夜还有人打电话来，我还以为出事了。", "meaning_en": "middle of the night", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0013-ex3", "sentence": "我半夜才到家，今天很累。", "meaning_en": "midnight", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0013-ex1", "translation": "He felt unwell at midnight, and everyone at home was very worried."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0013-ex2", "translation": "Someone even called in the middle of the night, and I thought something had happened."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0013-ex3", "translation": "I only got home at midnight, so I am very tired today."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0041", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "本地", "display_form": "本地", "pos": "adjective, noun", "rank": 41, "pronunciation": "běndì"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "local", "secondary_glosses": ["the local area"], "notes": "Usually describes something from the local area, such as local food, local conditions, or local media."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0041-ex1", "sentence": "我想先吃一点本地菜。", "meaning_en": "local", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0041-ex2", "sentence": "他对本地情况很熟，所以大家都问他。", "meaning_en": "local", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0041-ex3", "sentence": "这个节目只在本地电视台播放。", "meaning_en": "local", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0041-ex1", "translation": "I want to try some local dishes first."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0041-ex2", "translation": "He knows the local situation well, so everyone asks him."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0041-ex3", "translation": "This program is shown only on the local TV station."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0050", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "毕竟", "display_form": "毕竟", "pos": "adverb", "rank": 50, "pronunciation": "bìjìng"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "after all", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "Used when giving a reason or reminding someone of an important fact that should not be forgotten."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0050-ex1", "sentence": "他第一次来这里，毕竟还不太熟。", "meaning_en": "after all", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0050-ex2", "sentence": "我还是决定帮他，毕竟我们认识很多年了。", "meaning_en": "after all", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0050-ex3", "sentence": "你先休息吧，身体毕竟更重要。", "meaning_en": "after all", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0050-ex1", "translation": "It is his first time here; after all, he is still not very familiar with the place."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0050-ex2", "translation": "I still decided to help him; after all, we have known each other for many years."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0050-ex3", "translation": "Rest first. After all, your health matters more."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0054", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "必需", "display_form": "必需", "pos": "adjective", "rank": 54, "pronunciation": "bìxū"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "essential; indispensable", "secondary_glosses": ["required"], "notes": "Describes something that is necessary and cannot really be left out."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0054-ex1", "sentence": "水和空气都是人必需的。", "meaning_en": "indispensable", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0054-ex2", "sentence": "这些药不是现在必需的，可以以后再买。", "meaning_en": "essential", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0054-ex3", "sentence": "做这份工作，耐心是必需的。", "meaning_en": "essential", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0054-ex1", "translation": "Water and air are both indispensable to human life."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0054-ex2", "translation": "These medicines are not essential right now, and you can buy them later."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0054-ex3", "translation": "For this job, patience is essential."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0068", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "病房", "display_form": "病房", "pos": "noun", "rank": 68, "pronunciation": "bìngfáng"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "hospital ward", "secondary_glosses": ["ward"], "notes": "A hospital room or section where patients stay and receive care."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0068-ex1", "sentence": "医生说病房里要保持安静。", "meaning_en": "ward", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0068-ex2", "sentence": "她一醒来，就先看了看病房四周。", "meaning_en": "ward", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0068-ex3", "sentence": "到时间了，大家都离开了病房。", "meaning_en": "ward", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0068-ex1", "translation": "The doctor said the ward must stay quiet."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0068-ex2", "translation": "As soon as she woke up, she looked around the ward first."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0068-ex3", "translation": "When the time was up, everyone left the ward."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0074", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "不幸", "display_form": "不幸", "pos": "adverb, adjective, noun", "rank": 74, "pronunciation": "búxìng"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "unfortunately; unfortunate", "secondary_glosses": ["misfortune"], "notes": "Can introduce something unfortunate, describe something unfortunate, or refer to misfortune itself."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0074-ex1", "sentence": "不幸的是，他刚到车站就下起雨来。", "meaning_en": "unfortunately", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0074-ex2", "sentence": "这次意外给她带来了不幸。", "meaning_en": "misfortune", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0074-ex3", "sentence": "听到这个不幸的消息，大家都沉默了。", "meaning_en": "unfortunate", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0074-ex1", "translation": "Unfortunately, it started raining as soon as he got to the station."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0074-ex2", "translation": "This accident brought misfortune to her."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0074-ex3", "translation": "Hearing this unfortunate news, everyone fell silent."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0080", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "不然", "display_form": "不然", "pos": "conjunction", "rank": 80, "pronunciation": "bùrán"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "otherwise", "secondary_glosses": ["or else"], "notes": "A spoken linker used before the bad or unwanted result that will happen if the earlier advice is not followed."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0080-ex1", "sentence": "你快点出门，不然就赶不上车了。", "meaning_en": "otherwise", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0080-ex2", "sentence": "先问清楚，不然容易出错。", "meaning_en": "otherwise", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0080-ex3", "sentence": "先说清楚，不然大家听不懂。", "meaning_en": "otherwise", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0080-ex1", "translation": "Leave quickly, otherwise you will not catch the bus."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0080-ex2", "translation": "Ask clearly first, otherwise it is easy to make a mistake."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0080-ex3", "translation": "Explain it clearly first, otherwise everyone will not understand."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0084", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "裁判", "display_form": "裁判", "pos": "noun, verb", "rank": 84, "pronunciation": "cáipàn"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "referee; judge", "secondary_glosses": ["to judge"], "notes": "Can mean a referee or judge in a competition, and it can also mean to judge or decide the result."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0084-ex1", "sentence": "这场比赛的裁判很公平。", "meaning_en": "referee", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0084-ex2", "sentence": "最后由三位老师来裁判结果。", "meaning_en": "judge", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0084-ex3", "sentence": "裁判一说开始，比赛就开始了。", "meaning_en": "referee", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0084-ex1", "translation": "The referee in this match is very fair."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0084-ex2", "translation": "In the end, three teachers will judge the result."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0084-ex3", "translation": "As soon as the referee said to start, the match began."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0089", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "参考", "display_form": "参考", "pos": "verb, noun", "rank": 89, "pronunciation": "cānkǎo"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "refer to; consult", "secondary_glosses": ["reference"], "notes": "Can mean to consult or refer to something, and it also appears in the noun use for reference."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0089-ex1", "sentence": "你可以先参考一下去年的计划。", "meaning_en": "refer to", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0089-ex2", "sentence": "做这个题时，不能参考别人的答案。", "meaning_en": "consult", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0089-ex3", "sentence": "这些内容只是参考，不是最后结果。", "meaning_en": "for reference", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0089-ex1", "translation": "You can first refer to last year's plan."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0089-ex2", "translation": "When doing this problem, you cannot consult other people's answers."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0089-ex3", "translation": "These contents are only for reference and are not the final result."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0265", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "等于", "display_form": "等于", "pos": "verb", "rank": 265, "pronunciation": "děngyú"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "to equal; to amount to", "secondary_glosses": ["be tantamount to"], "notes": "Can mean being exactly equal in value or number, and it also often means amounting to the same result."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0265-ex1", "sentence": "三加二等于五。", "meaning_en": "equal", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0265-ex2", "sentence": "一小时等于六十分钟。", "meaning_en": "be equal to", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0265-ex3", "sentence": "现在不学，等于以后更难。", "meaning_en": "to amount to", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0265-ex1", "translation": "Three plus two equals five."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0265-ex2", "translation": "One hour equals sixty minutes."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0265-ex3", "translation": "If you do not study now, that amounts to making things harder later."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0571", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "简直", "display_form": "简直", "pos": "adverb", "rank": 571, "pronunciation": "jiǎnzhí"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "simply; downright", "secondary_glosses": ["really", "practically"], "notes": "An emphatic adverb used when the speaker feels something is really or almost unbelievably so."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0571-ex1", "sentence": "这个问题简直太难了。", "meaning_en": "simply", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0571-ex2", "sentence": "他忙得简直没时间吃饭。", "meaning_en": "absolutely", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0571-ex3", "sentence": "外面简直像夏天一样热。", "meaning_en": "practically", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0571-ex1", "translation": "This question is simply too hard."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0571-ex2", "translation": "He is so busy that he has absolutely no time to eat."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0571-ex3", "translation": "It is practically as hot as summer outside."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0618", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "近期", "display_form": "近期", "pos": "adverb, noun", "rank": 618, "pronunciation": "jìnqī"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "recently; in the near term", "secondary_glosses": ["the recent period"], "notes": "Refers to the recent period or the near future, and is broader in time than 近日."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0618-ex1", "sentence": "近期天气变化很大，大家要多注意。", "meaning_en": "recently", "difficulty": 2, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0618-ex2", "sentence": "公司近期不会涨价。", "meaning_en": "in the near term", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0618-ex3", "sentence": "我近期有点忙，过几天再找你。", "meaning_en": "recently", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0618-ex1", "translation": "Weather has been changing a lot recently, so everyone should be more careful."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0618-ex2", "translation": "The company will not raise prices in the near term."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0618-ex3", "translation": "I have been a little busy recently, so I will get back to you in a few days."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-0722", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "临时", "display_form": "临时", "pos": "adverb, adjective", "rank": 722, "pronunciation": "línshí"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "temporary; at the last minute", "secondary_glosses": ["temporarily"], "notes": "Can describe something temporary, or something that changes suddenly at the last minute."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-0722-ex1", "sentence": "我临时有事，今天不能去了。", "meaning_en": "at the last minute", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0722-ex2", "sentence": "这是我们今天的临时安排。", "meaning_en": "temporary", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-0722-ex3", "sentence": "公司临时通知大家开会。", "meaning_en": "at the last minute", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0722-ex1", "translation": "Something came up at the last minute, so I cannot go today."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0722-ex2", "translation": "This is our temporary arrangement for today."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-0722-ex3", "translation": "The company informed everyone about the meeting at the last minute."}]}
