{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-1050", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "手术", "display_form": "手术", "pos": "noun, verb", "rank": 1050, "pronunciation": "shǒushù"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "surgery; to operate", "secondary_glosses": [], "notes": "Can mean a surgery as a noun, and it can also mean performing an operation as a verb in medical contexts."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-1050-ex1", "sentence": "医生说爸爸明天要做手术。", "meaning_en": "surgery", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1050-ex2", "sentence": "手术以后，他要休息一周。", "meaning_en": "surgery", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1050-ex3", "sentence": "情况比较急，医生准备马上给他手术。", "meaning_en": "to operate", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1050-ex1", "translation": "The doctor said Dad will need surgery tomorrow."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1050-ex2", "translation": "After the surgery, he needs to rest for a week."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1050-ex3", "translation": "The situation is rather urgent, and the doctor is preparing to operate on him right away."}]}
