{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-1338", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "要不", "display_form": "要不", "pos": "conjunction", "rank": 1338, "pronunciation": "yàobù"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "otherwise; how about", "secondary_glosses": ["or else"], "notes": "A spoken linker that can warn about an unwanted result, and it can also introduce a suggestion like how about...."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-1338-ex1", "sentence": "我们快点走，要不就迟到了。", "meaning_en": "otherwise", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1338-ex2", "sentence": "要不我们先回去，明天再来吧。", "meaning_en": "how about", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1338-ex3", "sentence": "现在买吧，要不明天没时间。", "meaning_en": "otherwise", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1338-ex1", "translation": "Let's go quickly, otherwise we will be late."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1338-ex2", "translation": "How about we go back first and come again tomorrow?"}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1338-ex3", "translation": "Buy it now, otherwise there will be no time tomorrow."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-1362", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "以", "display_form": "以", "pos": "preposition, conjunction", "rank": 1362, "pronunciation": "yǐ"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "by means of; taking ... as", "secondary_glosses": ["judging by"], "notes": "A formal function word used in patterns like 以...说明..., 以...为..., and 以...来看 to show means, standard, or point of view."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-1362-ex1", "sentence": "我们应该以事实说明问题。", "meaning_en": "by means of", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1362-ex2", "sentence": "我们以这个办法来做。", "meaning_en": "by means of", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1362-ex3", "sentence": "以现在的速度看，下午能到。", "meaning_en": "judging by", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1362-ex1", "translation": "We should explain the problem by means of facts."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1362-ex2", "translation": "We are doing it by using this method."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1362-ex3", "translation": "Judging by the current speed, we can arrive this afternoon."}]}
{"word": {"id": "new-hsk-5-1444", "lang": "zh", "lemma": "在内", "display_form": "在内", "pos": "postposition", "rank": 1444, "pronunciation": "zàinèi"}, "glosses": {"primary_gloss": "including", "secondary_glosses": ["within the total"], "notes": "Placed after a noun to show that it is included in the total, as in 经理在内 or 学费在内."}, "examples": [{"id": "new-hsk-5-1444-ex1", "sentence": "经理在内，大家都同意。", "meaning_en": "including", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": true}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1444-ex2", "sentence": "学费在内，一共要五千元。", "meaning_en": "including", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}, {"id": "new-hsk-5-1444-ex3", "sentence": "房租在内，这个月花了不少。", "meaning_en": "within the total", "difficulty": 3, "source": "orchestrator-strict-repair-2026-04-18-pass2", "is_primary": false}], "example_translations": [{"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1444-ex1", "translation": "Including the manager, everyone agreed."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1444-ex2", "translation": "Including tuition, it costs five thousand yuan in total."}, {"example_id": "new-hsk-5-1444-ex3", "translation": "Including rent, we spent quite a lot this month."}]}
